The following commands can be used to define interface cells, place wirebond pads, IO terminals to the instances and bondmaster to the IO instances:

```tcl
# Define interface cells
define_interface_cells -cell_list {cell1 cell2 cell3}

# Place wirebond pads
place_wiring_pads -pad_list {pad1 pad2 pad3}

# Define IO terminals
define_io -terminal_list {terminal1 terminal2 terminal3}

# Define bondmaster for IO instances
define_bondmaster -master_list {master1 master2 master3}
```

Please note that the cell, pad, terminal and master names need to be replaced with the actual names used in your design.

